ept is used a lot \ntl;dr i didn't enjoy it, but  you probably will.", "timestamp_created": 1566325775, "timestamp_updated": 1566325775, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.446935594081878662", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "54719182", "author": {"steamid": "76561198415821891", "personaname": "Vandelgard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vandelgard/", "num_games_owned": 49, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 52730, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 47535, "last_played": 1725467700, "avatar": "51ec3a196c925411934cd1ea65f426c4559e43d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "To new people who bought it, I can only recommend Exterminatus Mode and the Campaign until the second game comes out. Play it for the story\nThis game could've been so much more the last 10 years yet they chose not to.\n\nI do not fully recommend the game because they raised the price from 8 euro to 50 the day the Space Marine 2 Reveal Trailer came out from a different Studio. \nThey made an Anniversary Edition with not a single update patch into it on top of that.\n(As if they ever cared for this game smh)\nPvP the last 5 years at least, is full of cheaters, people that break animations to glitch their way through everything and those who abuse the Peer to Peer connection for their own benefit. One of the most unfriendly experiences, I cannot recommend that too. Things have become delusional the last couple of years in there.", "timestamp_created": 1566320469, "timestamp_updated": 1791280146, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during